description:
[José Mourinho](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jos%C3%A9_Mourinho) is a highly decorated [football](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Association_football) manager from Portugal who currently leads [Real Madrid CF](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Real_Madrid_CF). Nicknamed "The Special One", he was appointed on [a three-year deal in June 2026](https://www.realmadrid.com/en-US/news/club/latest-news/comunicado-oficial-mourinho-11-06-2026). Throughout his managerial career, he has won numerous championships with numerous different clubs but has never stayed with a single team for longer than two or three years.

He previously managed Real Madrid from 2010 to 2013 but was let go in 2013. Since then, he has been with six different clubs, including, most recently, Fenerbahçe, which let him go after one year, and Benfica, which Mourinho left after one year, in 2026, in order to return to Real Madrid.

As of late September 2026, Real Madrid, historically the [best team in La Liga](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/La_Liga_records_and_statistics#Titles), currently [sits fourth in the league standings](https://www.laliga.com/en-GB/laliga-easports/standing), amid reports that Mourinho and the club are [struggling](https://www.bbc.com/sport/football/articles/c620ld00n5n9o).&#x20;
